          "description": "Day-Ahead price for the price area in DKK.\n\nThe Day-Ahead Price (DKK) is calculated based on the Day-Ahead Price (EUR) and the Euro exchange rate from Danmarks Nationalbank. It may therefore deviate from Danish Day-Ahead prices seen elsewhere.",
          "comment": "The Day-Ahead prices indicate the balance between supply and demand.",
